<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General shall hold office for such term and subject to such conditions as the Minister may, after consultation with the Public Services Commission, determine."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
