<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "As a consequence of the vesting in the successor company of the property, rights and liabilities under subsection 3(1), the successor company shall issue such securities of the company as the Minister of Finance may, after consultation with the Minister, from time to time, direct."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
