<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Shares in the successor company held by the Minister of Finance shall be held by the Minister of Finance Incorporated under the Minister of Finance (Incorporation) Act 1957."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
