<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding any other written law or rule of law, it shall not be necessary to complete or register a transfer of shares of the kind referred to in subsection (2) consequent upon a change in the person holding the office of the Minister of Finance."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
