<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister of Finance may exercise all the rights and powers attaching to the shares in the successor company held by him."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
