<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_I__cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act shall come into force on such date as the Minister may, by notification in the Gazette, appoint; and the Minister may appoint different dates for the coming into force of different provisions of this Act,"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
