<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_15__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Minister may, by notification in the Gazette, declare any specification that has been adopted with or without modification, to be a standard specification or a provisional standard specification for the purposes of this Act, and may amend or withdraw any standard specification or provisional standard specification."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_15__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
