<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_15__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "No specification shall be declared to be a standard specification, and no standard specification shall be amended or withdrawn, unless the Minister is satisfied that the persons who may be affected by the declaration, amendment or withdrawal have had an opportunity to consider it and to comment thereon to the Minister or to the Council or to an authorized committee of the Council: Provided that this subsection shall not apply to a provisional standard specification."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_15__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_15> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
