<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_16__subsec_1__para_d> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_16__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_16__subsec_1__para_d> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "d" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
