<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_16__subsec_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "for assessment or examination, all documents;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
