<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_17> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_17__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
