<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@/~part_V__cl_21> <https://schema.org/text> "without prejudice to any other mode of citation, be cited by the title or number given to it by the Minister; and any such citation shall, unless the context otherwise requires, be deemed to refer to that standard specification as was in force at the time when the law was made."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/37/eng@> .
